    "lawCode": "Amd §374, Exec L",
    "lawSection": "Executive Law",
    "memo": " \nBILL NUMBER: S1218B\n\nSPONSOR: COMRIE\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend the executive law, in relation to the appointment for\nagricultural representation on the state fire prevention and building\ncode council\n\n \nPURPOSE:\n\nThis bill would expand the state fire prevention and building code coun-\ncil to eight members in addition to requiring a member to represent\nagricultural producers\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1 amends subdivision 1 of section 374 of the executive law to\namend paragraph (c.) to expand the council from seven to eight represen-\ntatives in addition to requiring an individual on the council to repre-\nsent agricultural producers.\n\nSection 2 establishes the Effective Date.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nChanges to the NYS Uniform Fire Prevention and Building Code have a\nsignificant impact on the agricultural community. These changes are\ndecided by the State Fire Prevention and Building Code Council, and\ncurrently there is no representation for NYS Agriculture on the council.\n\nThis bill adds an additional council member and requires there to be a\nrepresentative to represent agricultural producers.\n\n \nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\n2024: S1218A/ A1080A- Passed Assembly, amended to B print\n\n2023: S1218A/ A1080A - Passed Assembly\n\nS7115 of 2022: Passed Assembly, died in Senate\n\nA.9940 of 2020: Referred to Government Operations.\n\n \nFISCAL, PLICA ONS:\n\nNone\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n",
